<title>HONG KONG: GITIC Enterprises debuts at HK$4.50/shr.</title>
<headline>GITIC Enterprises debuts at HK$4.50/shr.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of construction materials and property concern GITIC Enterprises Ltd made their trading debut at HK$4.50 per share, compared with their issue price of HK$1.05 each.</p>
</text>
